    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this exceptional three-bedroom, two-bathroom top floor apartment to the market at No. 10 Garrison Mews, Cabinteely, Dublin 18.\nThis impressive property is presented in great condition throughout and comes to the market vacant with no onward chain. Extending to an impressive c. 110 sq.m of bright and generously proportioned living accommodation, No. 10 benefits from stunning extra-high ceilings which enhance the wonderful sense of space and natural light throughout. Positioned on the top floor of this quiet and highly regarded development, this superb apartment offers spacious and comfortable living in one of South Dublin's most sought-after residential locations.\nNestled within the highly desirable area of Cabinteely, the location is exceptionally well positioned with a wealth of amenities close by. Cabinteely Village and Cornelscourt Shopping Centre are both within easy reach, offering a fantastic selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday conveniences. The area is also surrounded by an excellent choice of primary and secondary schools, while recreational amenities include Cabinteely Park, Kilbogget Park and the nearby coastline. Transport links are excellent, with easy access to the N11, LUAS at Cherrywood and the M50 motorway, providing swift and convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\nInternally, the accommodation is bright, spacious and exceptionally well laid out. The property briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway leading into a substantial open-plan living and dining area, with access to a private balcony, and a fully fitted kitchen. There are three generous double bedrooms, with the impressive master bedroom benefiting from a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite bathroom. A spacious main family bathroom completes the accommodation.\nOne of the standout features of No. 10 Garrison Mews is its enviable top floor position, coupled with the impressive extra-high ceilings which create a particularly bright and airy atmosphere throughout. The substantial c. 110 sq.m floor area, private balcony, excellent condition and vacant possession further add to the appeal. This property represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, those looking to trade up or anyone seeking a spacious home within a peaceful yet exceptionally convenient South Dublin setting.\nEarly viewing is highly advised.\nKey Features\n•Exceptional 3 bedroom, 2 bathroom top floor apartment\n•Approx. 110 sq.m of generous living accommodation\n•Impressive high ceilings throughout\n•Management fees c. 2800 per anum\n•Presented in great condition\n•Vacant with no onward chain\n•Private balcony\n•Large open-plan living and dining area\n•Fully fitted kitchen\n•Three generous double bedrooms\n•Master bedroom with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\n•Spacious main family bathroom\n•Quiet and well-maintained development\n•Highly sought-after Cabinteely location\n•Close to Cabinteely Village and Cornelscourt Shopping Centre\n•Excellent selection of schools, shops and recreational amenities nearby\n•Easy access to N11, LUAS and M50\n•Ideal for first-time buyers, investors or those trading up\nDirections - D18 V2Y1\n"
      },
      {
